    "body": "## Problem\r\n\r\nI find I'm used to hitting `<CR>` to skip past messages and I'd like to have it dismiss the ui2 window, rather than focus it, keeping both `:messages` and `g<` to focus it\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nAllow the `<CR>` for entering the ui2 window to be configurable\r\n\r\n## Alternate solution\r\n\r\nAllow \"real\" mappings to enter the ui2 window, instead of reading the last typed characters",
    "closed_at": null,
    "comment_data": [],
    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "i think we should drop this default behavior, it's not reliable enough, sometimes i end up n the pager when i don't want to be.\r\n\r\nanyway, we should try to avoid adding a random option for this, as this PR does. the pager/msgarea/etc already set `filetype` and you can set or unset mappings on `FileType` event. if that doesn't work, can we figure out why, and make it work?\r\n\r\ncc @luukvbaal ",
            "created_at": "2026-07-26T21:43:25Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/40993#issuecomment-5085534138",
