        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Sounds good. I'll change this PR to:\r\n- remove `<CR>` and `g<`\r\n- make `g<` a [default mapping](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/fbcb7a056cef7a5efd7aa7f494365a04b1c86895/runtime/doc/vim_diff.txt#L142-L178)\r\n  - Since the behaviour of it and `:messages` is slightly different (`g<` showing just the most recent slew of messages), perhaps mapping `g<` to something like `:messages recent` ?\r\n\r\nWill wait to see what @luukvbaal says first though.",
